{"ID":"20240205153748-igsdarp","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153748-igsdarp","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153748-igsdarp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105055-c3qbdzv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619184640-yz4nj2s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3000\u0026#125;","title":"金钱草","type":"doc","updated":"20240902175533"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105055-c3qbdzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105055-c3qbdzv","updated":"20240206105100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"金钱草"}]},{"ID":"20240619183527-z81xjmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619183527-z81xjmm","updated":"20240619183527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、贵州、云南等地区。\n【性状】\t全草多皱缩成团，下部茎节上有时着生纤细须根。茎扭曲，直径约1mm；表面红棕色，具纵直纹理；断面实心，灰白色。叶对生，多皱缩破碎，完整叶宽卵形或心形，全缘，上面暗绿色至棕绿色，下面色较浅，用水浸后，透光可见黑色短条纹；叶柄细长，叶腋有时可见花或果实。气微、味淡。\n【性味】\t甘、咸，微寒。\n【功效】\t利水通淋；清热解毒；散瘀消肿。主治肝胆及泌尿系结石；热淋；肾炎水肿；湿热黄疸；疮毒痈肿；毒蛇咬伤；跌打损伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105104-ja5wrof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105104-ja5wrof","updated":"20240206105104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105104-dhfoxqa.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727162824-0zdkuw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727162824-0zdkuw4","updated":"20240727163502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 321px;","style":"width: 311px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金钱草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金钱草 8-20240727160529-it9pm56.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 311px;\" parent-style=\"width: 321px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 355px;","style":"width: 345px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金钱草 (19)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金钱草 19-20240727163501-ssghmai.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 345px;\" parent-style=\"width: 355px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727160129-2lcmkty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727160129-2lcmkty","updated":"20240727160129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 351px;","style":"width: 341px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金钱草 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金钱草 7-20240727160129-5g5retg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 341px;\" parent-style=\"width: 351px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 821px;","style":"width: 811px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金钱草 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金钱草 1-20240727153116-fyfaipl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 811px;\" parent-style=\"width: 821px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727161342-2yxfzue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727161342-2yxfzue","updated":"20240727161342"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 555px;","style":"width: 545px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金钱草 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金钱草 9-20240727161239-eiscqbh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 545px;\" parent-style=\"width: 555px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 554px;","style":"width: 544px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金钱草 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金钱草 10-20240727161322-yu31bdg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 544px;\" parent-style=\"width: 554px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727152954-0crmwvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727152954-0crmwvu","updated":"20240727152954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 651px;","style":"width: 641px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"银环蛇 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/银环蛇 4-20240727152954-j1genu1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 641px;\" parent-style=\"width: 651px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 581px;","style":"width: 571px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金钱草 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/金钱草 2-20240727153430-klevhbg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 571px;\" parent-style=\"width: 581px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240206105103-kwwrtk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105103-kwwrtk6","updated":"20240727163525"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：有说法称金钱草=过路黄，其实两者不一样，金钱草贴地面生长无毛开单黄花，叶面中间有紫色，过路黄有绒毛开单黄花；"}]},{"ID":"20240206105103-cu9on4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105103-cu9on4j"}},{"ID":"20240206104901-ucfwo2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104901-ucfwo2w","updated":"20240206104901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"广金钱草"}]},{"ID":"20240206104910-t3ukmt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104910-t3ukmt3","updated":"20240206104912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖南、福建、以及两广地区。\n【性状】\t干燥的茎枝呈圆柱形，长可达60cm，粗2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5mm，表面淡棕黄色，密被黄色绒毛，质跪易断，断面淡黄色，中心具白色髓。叶皱缩，易脱落，上面灰绿色至暗绿色，无毛，下面浅绿色，密被白色茸毛。茎节处常有托叶，披针形锥尖，浅棕色。生药中偶见花果。气微弱，味淡。\n【性味】\t甘、淡，平。\n【功效】\t清热除湿，利尿通淋。用于热淋、砂淋、石淋、小便涩痛、水肿尿少、黄疸、尿赤、尿路结石。"}]},{"ID":"20240206104853-trfdya7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104853-trfdya7","updated":"20240206104853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206104853-jcynelc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161401-tgj1rlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161401-tgj1rlz","updated":"20240206104847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{